<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS - Livingstone Resources plans ASX listing.</title>
<headline>RTRS - Livingstone Resources plans ASX listing.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gold and diamond explorer Livingstone Resources NL said on Friday that it expected to list on the Australian Stock Exchange later this month after raising A$6.4 million.</p>
<p>The company offered 32 million shares at 20 cents each, with a free option for every two shares.</p>
<p>Its exploration activities centre on two Western Australian gold properties, one in the Golden Grove region and the other near 140 km northwest of Meekathara. Livingstone also has six diamond properties in the state's Nabberu Basin.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
